WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:01.780
- [Announcer] This Great
Big Story was made possible

00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:06.563
by Wells Fargo, established
1852, re-established 2018.

00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:09.930
- [Narrator] Nestled in the
jungles of Bali there's a small

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:12.839
village a little different from the rest.

00:00:12.839 --> 00:00:15.756
(methodical music)

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:24.080
In the region of Bengkala,
there's a recessive gene

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:25.830
common among the residents that causes

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:27.720
a much higher rate of deafness.

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:30.563
It's been passed down
through seven generations.

00:00:41.987 --> 00:00:45.280
In a town of 3,000, normally,
only four or five people

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:47.970
would be born Deaf, making
Bengkala's proportion

00:00:47.970 --> 00:00:50.163
of Deaf residents incredibly unique.

00:00:56.670 --> 00:00:59.840
This sign language is known
only to the people of Bengkala

00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:01.920
because it was created by them.

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:04.000
It's different from
any other sign language

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:05.050
throughout the world.

00:01:05.957 --> 00:01:08.874
(methodical music)

00:01:12.020 --> 00:01:14.770
Every part of town has adopted
to their Deaf neighbors.

00:01:15.910 --> 00:01:18.460
The mayor speaks Kata Kolok.

00:01:18.460 --> 00:01:20.690
The farmers speak Kata Kolok.

00:01:20.690 --> 00:01:22.633
The teachers speak Kata Kolok.

00:01:36.056 --> 00:01:38.473
(soft music)

